  "description": "When you wish upon a pop star… will dreams come true? 19-year-old Cinder Glass dreams of a music career, but has had no luck in breaking out as a singer on social media, until one day his cover of pop sensation Charm's latest single goes viral. An opportunity arises, and Cinder's fairy tale ending might come true… but only if he and Charm can stomach each other! Is his time up? Or are the idealistic Cinder and the jaded Charm actually a perfect fit?\nSource: Webtoon",
